    {
      "id": "negation_and_mix",
      "tier": "regression",
      "turns": [
        {"id": "softer_without_sparser", "text": "鼓收着点，我说的是轻一点，打点的样子照旧，谁都别停。", "state": {"tempo": 96, "playing": true, "layers.drums.level": ["<", "before.layers.drums.level"], "layers.drums.density": ["=", "before.layers.drums.density"], "layers.drums.active": true}, "notes": {"drums": [">", 0]}, "preserve_other_layers": ["drums"]},
        {"id": "sparser_without_quieter", "text": "现在键盘少垫几次，但每一下仍然用原来的力度。不要顺手调鼓。", "state": {"layers.keys.density": ["<", "before.layers.keys.density"], "layers.keys.level": ["=", "before.layers.keys.level"], "tempo": 96}, "preserve_other_layers": ["keys"]},
        {"id": "mute_bass_only", "text": "另外啊，先让贝斯一个人歇歇，其余照演，别整队按停。", "state": {"playing": true, "layers.bass.active": false, "tempo": 96}, "notes": {"bass": 0, "keys": [">", 0], "drums": [">", 0]}, "preserve_other_layers": ["bass"]},
        {"id": "do_not_unmute_when_continuing", "text": "继续同样的伴奏。贝斯还不用跟进来，鼓也别停。", "state": {"music": ["=", "before.music"], "layers.bass.active": false, "layers.drums.active": true}, "notes": {"bass": 0, "drums": [">", 0]}}
      ]
